#==============================================================================================
#
#   animatable - Animations::Animatable: an element's animations and transitions state
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Animations/Animatable.cpp (lines 15-17, 69-129 and 137-301): the
#       relevant animations of an element, its CSS-defined animations per pseudo-element, its
#       registered transitions and their attributes, and visit_edges. Taken ahead of phase 4 by
#       region r43, because StyleComputer::compute_style_impl asks every element for these
#       (process_animation_definitions, get_animations_internal, the transitions) and the
#       layout tree is built from computed styles. Animatable::animate, get_animations and
#       the (un)association and CSS animation registry members stay with phase 4.
